        "name": {
          "en-US": "Smart Ringtone"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Automatically adjust contact ringtones based on call activity"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Smart Ringtone automatically changes contact-specific ringtones based on your call history.\n\nThe app tracks missed, rejected, incoming, and outgoing calls, assigning a score to each contact. As a contact's score changes, Smart Ringtone can automatically update their ringtone, helping important callers stand out.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Automatic contact ringtone assignment\n* Configurable ringtone priority levels\n* Call score tracking based on call activity\n* Support for missed, rejected, incoming, and outgoing calls\n* Contact score management and reset controls\n* Local processing with no account required\n* No internet connection required\n\nSmart Ringtone uses Android's built-in contact ringtone functionality and performs all processing on the device. No call logs, contacts, or personal information are transmitted to external servers.\n\nRequired permissions:\n\n* Contacts - to read and update contact ringtone settings\n* Phone State - to detect call state changes\n* Call Logs - to process call activity and update scores\n"
        },
